# Flowchart – Case Study 4

```mermaid
flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[/Input subjects and student names/]
 B --> C[Build nested marks matrix]
 C --> D[Validate marks]
 D --> E[Calculate each student's total and average]
 E --> F[Find top performer]
 F --> G[Calculate each subject average]
 G --> H{Subject average below 50?}
 H -- Yes --> I[Flag low-performing subject]
 H -- No --> J[Continue]
 I --> J
 J --> K{More subjects?}
 K -- Yes --> G
 K -- No --> L[Display student and subject analysis]
 L --> M([Stop])
```
